{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Doubly-linked list/Element definition", ALGOL 68 solution doubly-linked-list-element-definition.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Doubly-linked_list/Element_definition#ALGOL_68
